  "notes": "INTENSITY:\n{引|ひ}っ{張|ぱ}る is more emphatic and forceful than ⟦{引|ひ}く→引く：01978_hiku⟧. The っ{張|ぱ}る pattern adds intensity.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}っ{張|ぱ}る\n\nCOMPOUND VERB FORMATION:\n⟦{引|ひ}く→引く：01978_hiku⟧ + っ + ⟦{張|は}る→張る：12583_haru⟧ = emphatic pulling action\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{足|あし}→足：00575_ashi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}っ{張|ぱ}る: to hold someone back, to be a burden\n- ⟦{引|ひ}っ{張|ぱ}りだこ→引っ張りだこ：21393_hipparidako⟧: very much in demand (lit. \"pulled octopus\")\n- ⟦チーム→チーム：03858_chiimu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}っ{張|ぱ}る: to lead a team\n\nRELATED COMPOUNDS:\n- {引|ひ}っ{張|ぱ}り⟦{込|こ}む→込む：00719_komu⟧: to drag into\n- {引|ひ}っ{張|ぱ}り⟦{出|だ}す→出す：01087_dasu⟧: to pull out, to drag out",
